## 第 2 步：加 Old 和 New 两列
在 Data 面板选中 `SQL_Qnotes Tasks`，Table tools > New column，分两次粘贴：

```dax
#Old Notif No = 
VAR _nbr = 'SQL_Qnotes Tasks'[NTFCTN_NBR]
VAR _match =
    FILTER (
        'Custom_QN ECC to S4 Mapping',
        'Custom_QN ECC to S4 Mapping'[New QN No] = _nbr
    )
RETURN
    IF (
        LEFT ( _nbr, 3 ) = "204",
        IF (
            NOT ISEMPTY ( _match ),
            CONCATENATEX (
                _match,
                'Custom_QN ECC to S4 Mapping'[Old QN No],
                ", ",
                'Custom_QN ECC to S4 Mapping'[Old QN No], ASC
            )
        ),
        _nbr
    )
```

```dax
#New Notif No = 
VAR _nbr = 'SQL_Qnotes Tasks'[NTFCTN_NBR]
VAR _match =
    FILTER (
        'Custom_QN ECC to S4 Mapping',
        'Custom_QN ECC to S4 Mapping'[Old QN No] = _nbr
    )
RETURN
    IF (
        LEFT ( _nbr, 3 ) = "204",
        _nbr,
        IF (
            NOT ISEMPTY ( _match ),
            CONCATENATEX (
                _match,
                'Custom_QN ECC to S4 Mapping'[New QN No],
                ", ",
                'Custom_QN ECC to S4 Mapping'[New QN No], ASC
            )
        )
    )
```

## 第 3 步：加去重用的标记列
同样选中 `SQL_Qnotes Tasks`，New column：

```dax
#ECC Superseded by S4 = 
IF (
    'SQL_Qnotes Tasks'[NTFCTN_NBR] IN VALUES ( 'Custom_QN ECC to S4 Mapping'[Old QN No] ),
    "Y",
    "N"
)
```

## 第 4 步：改 Details table
打开 Qnotes (MDI Format) 页，点中 Qnotes Details 表：

1. 把 `#Old Notif No` 拖到 Columns 最上面，`#New Notif No` 拖到第二位。
2. 点 X 删掉原来的 Notif No。
3. 双击这两个字段，改显示名为 `Old Notif No` 和 `New Notif No`。
4. 把 `#ECC Superseded by S4` 拖到 Filters 面板的 Filters on this visual，只勾 `N`。
5. 多了一列后总宽度可能超出一点，把 Person Responsible 或 HAL Core Sourcing 拉窄一些。

## 第 5 步：验证
在 DAX query view 里跑：

```dax
EVALUATE
VAR _shown =
    FILTER (
        'SQL_Qnotes Tasks',
        'SQL_Qnotes Tasks'[#Task Status] <> "Completed"
            && 'SQL_Qnotes Tasks'[#ECC Superseded by S4] = "N"
    )
RETURN
    ROW (
        "Rows shown", COUNTROWS ( _shown ),
        "Old and New", COUNTROWS ( FILTER ( _shown, 'SQL_Qnotes Tasks'[#Old Notif No] <> "" && 'SQL_Qnotes Tasks'[#New Notif No] <> "" ) ),
        "Old blank", COUNTROWS ( FILTER ( _shown, 'SQL_Qnotes Tasks'[#Old Notif No] = "" ) ),
        "New blank", COUNTROWS ( FILTER ( _shown, 'SQL_Qnotes Tasks'[#New Notif No] = "" ) )
    )
```

